          "viz": "<svg viewBox='0 0 660 130' role='img' aria-label='基线建模：把可恢复的温度贡献扣掉，剩下的才需要解释' style='width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:12px 0;border:1px solid #DDD8CB;border-radius:10px;background:#fff' font-family=\"system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\"><rect x='0' y='0' width='660' height='130' fill='#FBFaf6'/><text x='12' y='20' font-size='9' fill='#4d565b'>基线用本井自己的数据建：环空容积与流体膨胀系数各井不同，通用系数会偏</text><line x1='60' y1='92' x2='400' y2='92' stroke='#242b2e' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='60' y1='92' x2='60' y2='28' stroke='#242b2e' stroke-width='1'/><text x='180' y='108' font-size='8.5' fill='#79828a'>时间 →</text><text x='46' y='38' font-size='8.5' fill='#79828a'>压力</text><polyline points='70,84 110,80 150,74 190,66 230,58 270,52 310,48 350,46 385,45' fill='none' stroke='#c9613f' stroke-width='2'/><text x='280' y='42' font-size='8.5' fill='#c9613f'>实测压力</text><polyline points='70,84 110,82 150,80 190,78 230,76 270,74 310,72 350,70 385,69' fill='none' stroke='#41699b' stroke-width='1.6' stroke-dasharray='5 3'/><text x='300' y='76' font-size='8.5' fill='#41699b'>温度预测（基线）</text><rect x='230' y='58' width='155' height='34' fill='#f4ded4' opacity='0.45'/><text x='246' y='74' font-size='8.5' fill='#8a3d20'>残余升压：实测 − 基线</text><rect x='430' y='36' width='218' height='58' rx='4' fill='#efece1' stroke='#e2ded0'/><text x='442' y='54' font-size='8.5' fill='#c9613f'>基线必须本井自建</text><text x='442' y='70' font-size='8.5' fill='#c9613f'>通用系数 → 系统性偏差</text><text x='442' y='88' font-size='8.5' fill='#2f7d6b'>残余速率是核心判据</text><text x='12' y='124' font-size='8.5' fill='#79828a'>扣得准不准决定分类准不准：基线偏移 1 MPa，分类就可能从窜流变成温度胀</text></svg><div class='viz-cap'>图：基线建模：把可恢复的温度贡献扣掉，剩下的才需要解释</div>"
